<report>
<line><title>False result probabilities</title></line>
<line></line>
<line>For an overall case rate of <in>population</in> per ten thousand population tested:</line>
<line></line>
<line>Test SENSITIVITY = <in>sensitive</in>%</line>
<line>Probability of a FALSE POSITIVE result = <pval><in>positive</in></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line>Test SPECIFICITY = <in>specific</in>%</line>
<line>Probability of a FALSE NEGATIVE result = <pval><in>negative</in></pval></line>
</report>
